<title>USA: NYSE closing averages.</title>
<headline>NYSE closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the New York Stock Exchange closed higher in heavy trading Wednesday.</p>
<p>The Dow Jones Industrial Average rose 3.33 to 5877.36.</p>
<p>The NYSE composite rose 0.07 to 365.30.</p>
<p>The average price per share rose $0.01.</p>
<p>Gainers beat losers 1298 to 1033.</p>
<p>Volume was 451,698,160, compared with 457,893,720 Tuesday.</p>
